綺麗な月の光が 始まりへと沈みゆく そのかなたへ 漉かされて
The beautiful moonlight sinks toward the beginning, freezing away into that horizon

87
00:16:47,959 --> 00:16:53,979
深みで眠れ 遠くへ手を伸ばす 君の嘆きを
Sleep in the depths, reaching out far into the distance, your lamentation...

88
00:17:00,759 --> 00:17:06,539
信じて
Believe in it

89
00:17:16,919 --> 00:17:22,559
本当は 誰が 救われたくて
Who is it that truly wanted to be saved?

90
00:17:22,559 --> 00:17:29,179
迷う心が 空に穴を穿つ 君を選んで
A wandering heart bores holes in the sky, choosing you

91
00:17:31,979 --> 00:17:39,979
正しさを探してたんだ 冷たい 炎に 身を焼かれても
Searching for righteousness, even if your body is scorched by cold flames

92
00:17:47,979 --> 00:17:54,099
微笑み近くの 音なき 夢
A voiceless dream close to a smile

93
00:18:01,399 --> 00:18:09,459
命の意味 解きほぐす この世界を 再び ズレの中へ 返したい
Untangling the meaning of life, I want to return this world back into misalignment

94
00:18:14,979 --> 00:18:22,719
悲しい だけじゃ 済まされない そんな 日々の こころの
Not just sadness alone, the heart in those days...

95
00:18:29,379 --> 00:18:37,339
断りさえ この手で 切り裂いて
Even refusal, I will slash through with this hand

96
00:18:41,959 --> 00:18:49,999
綺麗な 月の 光は ただ 静かに 始まりへ 朽ちてゆくよ
The beautiful moonlight simply decays quietly toward the beginning

97
00:18:54,379 --> 00:19:02,159
交さされた 憧れは まだ 遠くへ 手を伸ばす
Intersected yearnings still reach out far into the distance

98
00:19:02,159 --> 00:19:09,639
君の 嘆きを 信じて
Believing in your lamentation

99
00:19:12,219 --> 00:19:22,479
優しい 歌声が 降り注ぐ世界で ひとり 囁き合う 未来よ
In a world where gentle singing pours down, a future where we whisper to each other alone

100
00:19:32,024 --> 00:19:36,024
綺麗な月の光は...
The beautiful moonlight...

101
00:20:15,182 --> 00:20:20,382
目覚めては繰り返す 眠い朝は
Waking up and repeating, sleepy mornings...

102
00:20:21,182 --> 00:20:26,582
襟のタイをきつく締め
...tie my collar nice and tight.

103
00:20:28,082 --> 00:20:33,782
教室のドアくぐると ほんの少し
Passing through the classroom door, just a little...

104
00:20:34,582 --> 00:20:40,382
胸を張って歩き出せる
...puffing out my chest and stepping forward.

105
00:20:41,182 --> 00:20:47,382
そんな日常に 吹き抜ける風
A breeze blowing through such everyday life—

106
00:20:48,382 --> 00:20:56,582
聞こえた気がした 感じた気がしたんだ
I felt like I heard it, felt like I felt it.

107
00:20:57,382 --> 00:21:04,382
震え出す 今この胸で もう来る気がした
Trembling right here in my chest, I felt it coming.

108
00:21:05,182 --> 00:21:12,382
幾億の星が消え去ってくのを
Watching countless stars fade and drift away...

109
00:21:13,182 --> 00:21:18,382
見送った 手を振った
...I watched them go, waving goodbye.

110
00:21:19,382 --> 00:21:22,382
よかったねと
Saying "I'm glad."

111
00:21:24,782 --> 00:21:30,382
廊下の隅見下ろす 掃除の途中
Looking down from the hallway corner while cleaning,

112
00:21:31,182 --> 00:21:37,382
おかしなものだと思う
I think it's such a strange thing.

113
00:21:37,982 --> 00:21:43,982
話の中の時は こんなあてるのに
The time in stories is supposed to fit like this—

114
00:21:44,582 --> 00:21:50,382
違う日々を生きてるように
as if living completely different days.

115
00:21:50,982 --> 00:21:56,782
ほこりは雪のように降り積む
Dust piles up like falling snow.

116
00:21:57,582 --> 00:22:04,582
待ってる気がした 呼んでる気がしたんだ
I felt like it was waiting, felt like it was calling out.

117
00:22:07,182 --> 00:22:13,582
震え出す 今この時が 見つけた気がした
Trembling right at this moment, I felt like I found it.

118
00:22:14,382 --> 00:22:21,582
失われた記憶が 呼び覚ました
Lost memories were awakened once more.

119
00:22:22,182 --> 00:22:31,982
物語 永遠の その終わり
The story... the end of eternity.

120
00:22:34,182 --> 00:22:39,982
いつの間にか 駆け出してた
Before I knew it, I was running off...

121
00:22:40,382 --> 00:22:46,382
あなたに手を 引かれてた
...led by your hand.

122
00:22:47,382 --> 00:22:52,582
昨日は遠く 明日はすぐ
Yesterday is far, tomorrow is near—

123
00:22:53,182 --> 00:23:02,582
そんな当たり前に 心が踊った
my heart danced to such ordinary things.

124
00:23:05,382 --> 00:23:12,382
聞こえた気がした 感じた気がしたんだ
I felt like I heard it, felt like I felt it.

125
00:23:15,182 --> 00:23:22,382
震え出す 今この胸で もう来る気がした
Trembling right here in my chest, I felt it coming.

126
00:23:22,982 --> 00:23:30,382
幾千の朝を越え 新しい陽が
Crossing thousands of mornings, a new sun...

127
00:23:31,982 --> 00:23:40,382
待ってる気がした 呼んでる気がしたんだ
...I felt like it was waiting, felt like it was calling out.

128
00:23:41,182 --> 00:23:47,382
震えてる この魂が 見つけた気がした
This trembling soul of mine felt like it found it.

129
00:23:48,182 --> 00:23:55,382
幾億の夢のように 消え去れる日を
Like dreams of billions of years, the day we fade away—

130
00:23:56,182 --> 00:24:02,382
見送った 手を振った ありがとう
I watched them go, waved goodbye... Thank you.

131
00:24:47,882 --> 00:24:53,382
メフィスト
Mephisto

132
00:24:54,082 --> 00:25:00,072
メフィスト
Mephisto

133
00:25:00,875 --> 00:25:06,055
ラストチャンスにうえ立つつま先が踊りだすままかけたこの夜空
The toes poised for a final chance start to dance into this night sky...

134
00:25:06,795 --> 00:25:12,675
波のスタンスじゃなびかない 星は宝石の憧れ
Unfazed by ordinary stances, stars are a jewel's desire.

