00:44:06,168 --> 00:44:15,218
今年最初の雪の華を 2人寄り添って
This year's first snow flower, cuddling close together,

287
00:44:16,068 --> 00:44:22,318
眺めているこの時間に シアワセがあふれだす
Looking at it, happiness overflows in this moment.

288
00:44:23,068 --> 00:44:31,318
甘えとか弱さじゃない ただキミとずっと
It's not weakness or dependence, just wanting to be with you forever,

289
00:44:32,068 --> 00:44:39,318
このままで一緒にいたい 素直にそう思える
I want to stay together just like this, I can honestly feel that way.

290
00:44:40,068 --> 00:44:49,318
この街に降り積もってく 真っ白な雪の華
Piling up on this town, pure white snow flowers,

291
00:44:50,068 --> 00:44:59,318
2人の胸にそっと 想い出を描くよ これからもキミと
Gently drawing memories in our hearts, from now on with you too.

292
00:47:49,265 --> 00:47:52,305
[Title: 罪の名前]
[Text: Lyrics, Music: ryo (supercell)]
[Title: Name of Sin]
[Text: Lyrics, Music: ryo (supercell)]

293
00:48:03,502 --> 00:48:10,342
お前の神様が目を留めた　なんて可愛い悪魔だったこと
Your God took notice of what a cute devil you were...

294
00:48:11,072 --> 00:48:13,852
そうだよ　あの子に魔法をかけて　遊びましょう
That's right, let's cast a spell on that child and play.

295
00:48:14,462 --> 00:48:18,982
そうだわ　あの子に魔法をかけて　遊びましょう
That's right, let's cast a spell on that child and play.

296
00:48:36,502 --> 00:48:43,702
窪んだ両目や不格好な身体　私を見れば誰が言うのです
With your sunken eyes and misshapen body, who would look at me and say—

297
00:48:44,272 --> 00:48:47,382
「化け物　お前は同じ人間じゃないんだよ」と
"Monster, you're not the same kind of human"?

298
00:48:59,872 --> 00:49:03,472
悲しいなんて思わない　だって思わない
I won't think it's sad, because I won't think so...

299
00:49:04,272 --> 00:49:13,572
だって思えばほら　涙が溢れて　震える
Because if I think about it, look, my tears overflow and I tremble.

300
00:49:14,872 --> 00:49:25,172
もしも願いが一つ叶うなら　世界でたった一人の友達を
If one wish could come true, I'd want just one friend in this entire world.

301
00:49:26,172 --> 00:49:37,572
生きることは素晴らしいこと　そんなふうに私も思ってみたい
To be able to live is a wonderful thing—I want to be able to feel that way too.

302
00:50:00,160 --> 00:50:05,230
眠いはなんで嫌われるのでしょう
Why is sleepiness so hated, I wonder?

303
00:50:05,230 --> 00:50:11,280
彼らは笑ってきた　ないからだろ
They just laughed because I don't have any...

304
00:50:11,280 --> 00:50:18,980
それなら答えて　目の見えない僕のために
If so, answer me, for my sightless self...

305
00:50:22,080 --> 00:50:27,580
見て見ぬふりに　入り口に戸惑う別れ
Turning a blind eye, parting while hesitating at the door...

306
00:50:28,080 --> 00:50:32,580
それはネズミと同居し汚い
Living with rats, it's so filthy.

307
00:50:33,080 --> 00:50:41,080
後悔さ彼らに　続けて言うんだ　二度ととするな
Continuing to tell them with regret, never do it again.

308
00:50:45,080 --> 00:50:48,580
嬉しいのに何ででしょう
Even though I'm happy, why is that, I wonder?

309
00:50:49,080 --> 00:50:59,580
だって涙がほらやっぱりあふれてくるのです
Because tears, see, they're overflowing after all.

310
00:51:00,580 --> 00:51:10,580
もしもなりたいものになれるなら　あなたの前では普通の女の子に
If I could become what I want to be, in front of you I'd be an ordinary girl...

311
00:51:12,080 --> 00:51:16,580
本当に胸が苦しい
My heart truly hurts so much.

312
00:51:17,080 --> 00:51:25,580
どうして私は私なのですか
Why is it that I am who I am?

313
00:51:29,080 --> 00:51:36,580
君はやさしい女の子なのにいつも自分を責める
You're such a kind girl, yet you always blame yourself.

314
00:51:37,080 --> 00:51:42,580
そうだここに咲いた花を君に捧げよう
That's right, let's offer the flowers blooming here to you.

315
