見にくいあの娘みたらどんな顔
What kind of face would she make seeing that unsightly girl?

319
00:52:22,580 --> 00:52:30,080
するんでしょ　見栄の折れと魔法をかける
She'd do it, casting a spell with a broken pride.

320
00:52:33,580 --> 00:52:44,080
花は黒く夜のように染める　それは吹き出さない黒いユリの花
The flowers dye black like the night, that is a black lily flower that won't sprout.

321
00:52:44,580 --> 00:52:52,580
お前に彼から贈り物だ　さらし者にな
A gift from him to you, as a public spectacle.

322
00:52:56,080 --> 00:53:09,580
ああこれはきっと罰です　だって私神様も知らずに恋をし　だから
Ah, this is surely punishment, because I fell in love without even knowing God, and so...

323
00:53:13,580 --> 00:53:22,080
いっそ死んでしまえばいいのでしょう　あなたは叫ぶ
It would be better if I just died, you scream.

324
00:53:22,580 --> 00:53:31,080
泣かないで僕がずっとそばにいるからさ
Don't cry, because I will always be by your side.

325
00:53:31,580 --> 00:53:44,080
だからさ今日から君は普通の女の子の子供さ　それに実はないの
So from today you are an ordinary girl's child...

326
00:53:44,580 --> 00:53:52,080
悪夢のような魔法はほら溶けた神様
Look, the nightmare-like spell has melted, God.

327
00:53:54,080 --> 00:54:02,580
……
......

328
00:54:10,080 --> 00:54:16,580
And that was "Tsumi no Namae" with my Promised ladies.
And that was "Tsumi no Namae" with my Promise ladies.

329
00:54:16,580 --> 00:54:24,580
