347
00:56:27,416 --> 00:56:36,596
ではね、あの、最後の曲「Twilight」、聞いてください。Please listen to my last song for today, and thank you so much for watching until the end. Please listen to Twilight!
Well, please listen to the final song, "Twilight". Please listen to my last song for today, and thank you so much for watching until the end. Please listen to Twilight!

