00:58:35,088 --> 00:58:45,088
Try Light 熱く広がる 刹那の黄昏よ
Try Light, hot and spreading, the transient twilight!

364
00:58:45,088 --> 00:58:55,088
Try Light 掛け違えても 全てのしるしだから
Try Light, even if buttoned wrong, it's all a sign, so...

