Try Light 掛け違えても 訂正はいらない Be oneself, Be myself
Try Light, even if buttoned wrong, no corrections needed. Be oneself, Be myself.

370
00:59:42,088 --> 00:59:52,088
リヴィジットふたつで Be oneself, Be myself 秘密の
Revisit with two, Be oneself, Be myself, a secret...

371
00:59:52,088 --> 00:59:59,988
Be oneself, Be myself リヴィジット心の日差すから
Be oneself, Be myself, because the heart's sunlight revisits.

